WalletWall OpenAI distribution adapter

The adapter builds against WalletWall Copilot, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The upstream projects and exact pins are recorded in upstream.json.
The vault-readiness skill is adapted for a remote MCP host from the matching
WalletWall Copilot and Claude skill. WalletWall attribution, evidence policies,
and point-in-time reference data originate in the pinned Copilot repository.

The WalletWall name and approved brick-wallet icon are used with the owner's
permission for this distribution. The Apache-2.0 license does not grant rights
in the WalletWall name or marks. See TRADEMARKS.md.
